# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the combined tp4/window-next four-card window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/window-next and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-next-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# O3 (PAIRED TIMING and the text read, the octo pack's P1, LEAN): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo, QWEN_FAST_OCTO=alternate, audits OFF, the tests of O2: every eligible round switches shape, so octo and M3 rounds are timed in PAIRS on this
# one boot, the same users at the same positions. READ: python scripts/ci/octo_judge.py --container-log <container log> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo --verdict: GO at >= +10% committed tokens per second per seat at 8 live
# (aggregate AND median pair, at least 16 pairs); and the text read, python scripts/ci/octo_compare.py --control <O2 smoke log> --octo <O3 smoke log> --octo-container <O3 container log> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo: every
# answer's content hash, reasoning hash, token count and finish reason equal, user by user (any difference is NO-GO). Both arms of this boot pay a full pre-stage per switch (every switch bumps the fixture epoch):
# the live-shape read without it is the octo pack's P2 (not in this lean path). Check the load average around the run (a busy host skews host phases 10 to 20%); the rig's CI runner sets stay scaled to zero until O4/H5
# are done. Duration (estimate): 60 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k
